  "content": "\n\n<p><em>大家好。首先，我強烈建議您透過官方的 CurseForge 和 Modrinth 平台下載本專案——這將增加創作者的獎勵。非常感謝大家的支持！！！</em></p>\n<p>1.20.1 版本也有對應的資料包。<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/disablealltheores\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/disablealltheores</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/s8vZR4PGr2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5bbeac16-ce39-4e62-a00a-71bea07c9ad9.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"41\"></em></a></p>\n<h3>停用 alltheores 模組的原生礦石生成。現在標準&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>alltheores <span style=\"font-size:16px\">模組的礦石將不會在世界任何地方生成，但來自附加模組的礦石仍會出現在世界中。</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ato\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">依賴於 All the Ores</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fiyouroverlord!\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2a0e2c4a-8c30-4d12-8c21-c4fdad28f14c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"218\" height=\"41\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/IYourOverlord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6eddf1c6-dc62-429b-9ffc-e126dc33f297.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"196\" height=\"46\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253dE7U2TQU7QAVJN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f338f258-c653-49f2-81d6-49c985f361cb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"152\" height=\"43\"></a></p>",
